    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are perfect. they sound really professional. for the conclusion of my video, i want to give a definitive verdict. given those points, can you help me write a closing statement that explains why traditional, more authoritative parenting is objectively better for raising resilient kids compared to the gentle parenting approach?",
